 Pointer theme stray
 Folder: /usr/share/icons/stray. Every file in the folder is active while the
 folder is.
 State: not active
 This pointer theme fails the trust rule, so vtium treats it as missing. The
 rule asks that the file and each folder above it belong to root, and that
 nobody else can write them. /usr/share/icons/stray/cursors/left_ptr: this
 symbolic link leaves the theme's folder.
 No look uses it.

 Up and Down scroll the detail, and Esc goes back to the list.









